### Report history (Sanctum Bearer required)
@base = https://cdrrmo-tandag.com/api/v1
@token = YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN

### Staff only — all users' call/message reports
GET {{base}}/report-history/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Own history (userId must match authenticated user)
GET {{base}}/report-history/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
